1
00:00:40,944 --> 00:00:45,765
=My Loong=

2
00:00:45,765 --> 00:00:49,170
=Episode 6=

3
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,679
Don't mimic the opera actors again.

4
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:03,479
Just trust me,

5
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,400
all right?

6
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,400
So you won't see him again?

7
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:09,680
Never.

8
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:11,480
- Promise?
- I promise.

9
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:14,799
Pinky swear.

10
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:16,079
Deal.

11
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,359
All right, we've given it all back

12
00:01:22,439 --> 00:01:23,799
except some snacks.

13
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,040
I still have some money.

14
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:30,319
Next time you go out,
you can't just take people's things.

15
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:32,280
If you want something,
you have to buy it,

16
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,239
or trade something of equal value
for it,

17
00:01:35,359 --> 00:01:37,959
like pearls and coral
from the Loong Abyss.

18
00:01:38,159 --> 00:01:39,159
Anything works.

19
00:01:48,719 --> 00:01:49,959
Why did you hide so much more?

20
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:50,959
I...

21
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:54,640
Forget it. We'll return them tomorrow.

22
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,359
Well...

23
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,359
You read this too?

24
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:10,639
Yes.

25
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,199
Look at this page.

26
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,560
Look here.

27
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,080
Look at this painting.

28
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,199
Take a look.

29
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,400
You and...

30
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,560
Look,

31
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:28,360
the look on her face
is different from yours.

32
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:30,879
She doesn't look like
she's in pain at all.

33
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,479
Mortal artists paint from imagination.

34
00:02:34,479 --> 00:02:35,479
Don't take it seriously.

35
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:39,879
Don't you look different
from the guy in the painting?

36
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:42,800
Should I be
like the person in the painting then?

37
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,319
Of course not.

38
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,719
You...

39
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:06,400
Your current look is super close
to the lady in that painting.

40
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,479
No more books like this.

41
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,759
Are you really studying this?

42
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,400
You're trembling.

43
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:19,600
The lady in the painting looks happy.

44
00:04:22,036 --> 00:04:23,832
♪If the wind were a verb♪

45
00:04:24,227 --> 00:04:26,827
♪Blowing through my thoughts♪

46
00:04:27,433 --> 00:04:29,496
♪Touching, then vanishing away♪

47
00:04:29,774 --> 00:04:32,397
♪Spreading throughout my heart♪

48
00:04:33,098 --> 00:04:37,437
♪I flipped when we met in our youth♪

49
00:04:38,816 --> 00:04:43,232
♪I seek in the moonlight
for the rest of my life♪

50
00:04:44,202 --> 00:04:47,162
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

51
00:04:47,162 --> 00:04:49,232
♪Take root after drowning♪

52
00:04:49,973 --> 00:04:55,232
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

53
00:04:55,232 --> 00:05:00,864
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

54
00:05:00,864 --> 00:05:06,454
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

55
00:05:06,454 --> 00:05:12,118
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

56
00:05:12,118 --> 00:05:17,751
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

57
00:05:17,751 --> 00:05:23,372
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

58
00:05:23,586 --> 00:05:32,756
♪A single tear
burns love and hate to ashes♪

59
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:43,839
Your Highness...

60
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,079
Get lost!

61
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,560
(The Loong Lord's guard? Ridiculous.)

62
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,920
(She already moved on to someone else?)

63
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,240
(That's not true.)

64
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,839
(She's totally doing this to spite me.)

65
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,240
(And how dare he!)

66
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:04,839
Go investigate.

67
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,319
Find out where he's from

68
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,720
and who he really is.

69
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:11,040
I want every single detail.

70
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:13,439
But be cautious.

71
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:18,480
Don't let the Yue family
trace Yue Wangshu's whereabouts.

72
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:20,199
Yes, Your Highness.

73
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,839
Stood me up again?
Is he really that busy?

74
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,839
Can't he make time
to help pick my accessories?

75
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:34,319
Fine. Prepare the sedan!

76
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:36,279
Since he won't come,
I'll tell his father on him.

77
00:06:37,279 --> 00:06:40,519
Who made my dear sister so mad?

78
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,600
You got this for Zhu Heng?

79
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,160
What a waste.

80
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,439
Are you here to laugh at me?

81
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:51,879
Of course not.

82
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,160
I came to congratulate you.

83
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,120
Dismissed, all of you.

84
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:06,600
Word arrived from the Loong Abyss
early this morning.

85
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:10,199
The boat used to sacrifice Yue Wangshu
washed ashore.

86
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:12,040
It was smashed to pieces,

87
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:14,480
covered in blood.

88
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,279
A dead woman
won't be an eyesore anymore.

89
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:23,199
Now you can just relax

90
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,680
and prepare for your wedding.

91
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:28,399
How can I relax, brother?

92
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:30,319
The boat is wrecked, and she's dead,

93
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,600
but what about his heart?

94
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,439
Even if Yue Wangshu is truly dead,

95
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,040
his heart is still with her!

96
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:37,279
A living woman

97
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:39,160
can't even beat a dead one
under the lake!

98
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,600
Isn't that pathetic?

99
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:44,120
So you're going
to complain to Prince Qi?

100
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,560
To let Prince Qi see

101
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:49,000
that the wife he handpicked for Zhu Heng

102
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,720
is just an embarrassing, jealous shrew,

103
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:56,120
stirring up petty drama
over trivial infatuations?

104
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:58,839
Zhu Heng cheated on me first!

105
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,040
You're being foolish.

106
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:03,480
Open your eyes.

107
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,360
Currently,

108
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:08,360
His Majesty has lost his power.

109
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,560
The one truly in charge is Prince Qi.

110
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:14,720
What are you getting at?

111
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:17,079
Soon enough,

112
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:18,399
Prince Qi will take the throne.

113
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,800
No matter how useless Zhu Heng is,

114
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,120
you must admit

115
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:25,360
he is the sole heir to the throne.

116
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,600
And you, Yue Lingluo,

117
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,839
are destined to be the Empress.

118
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:38,519
Fighting for a man's favor
is a concubine's game.

119
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:41,320
If you, the future Empress,
are that narrow-minded,

120
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:43,639
what will Prince Qi think of you?

121
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,639
What will he think of our family?

122
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:48,159
If this jeopardizes your marriage,

123
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,600
can you take it?

124
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:52,399
I understand.

125
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,080
That's my girl.

126
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,720
That's more like it.

127
00:09:02,604 --> 00:09:03,960
(General's Manor)

128
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:06,159
My Lord, you just got home.
Why are you...?

129
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:10,360
Any longer, and my head will explode.

130
00:09:12,039 --> 00:09:14,720
Zhu Heng, you are a hopeless romantic.

131
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,159
Since he sent his men,

132
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:19,960
is she really nowhere to be found?

133
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:23,600
Did Yue Xingyao go
to her mother's residence yesterday?

134
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,120
Yes, My Lord.

135
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:29,399
She values her sister over her own life.

136
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,919
Unless Yue Wangshu were still alive,

137
00:09:32,159 --> 00:09:34,320
she wouldn't be resting so peacefully.

138
00:09:34,639 --> 00:09:36,679
My Lord, do you suspect...?

139
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,960
Women are such a hassle.

140
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:43,320
But then again, Lingluo is my sister,

141
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:46,639
and Yue Wangshu has been an eyesore
since childhood.

142
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:48,559
If she really escaped,

143
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,559
it means she fled the sacrificial rite.

144
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:54,960
That's high treason.

145
00:09:56,080 --> 00:10:00,240
(Besides,
I'll never let you ruin my plans.)

146
00:10:15,985 --> 00:10:21,916
(Tomb of General Zhenbei
and First-Rank Lady)

147
00:10:28,799 --> 00:10:30,600
(Father, Mother.)

148
00:10:32,039 --> 00:10:35,480
(I never thought I'd visit you
with Xingyao like this again.)

149
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,919
(You loved each other so much,)

150
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,480
(a model couple in Daizhou.)

151
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:44,600
(Aunt Jiang Liuying)

152
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:47,799
(was able to connect
with Prince Qi's wife)

153
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:49,960
(only by riding on your reputation.)

154
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:54,559
(Tragically, the late Emperor died
in his prime,)

155
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,639
(and then you died of illness.)

156
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:59,120
(Since Prince Qi took regency,)

157
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:01,879
(Uncle and his men
have been clinging to him,)

158
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,120
(hoarding military power in Daizhou.)

159
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,559
(To secure their power,)

160
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:08,840
(they purged your loyal subordinates
one by one.)

161
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:13,039
(If Xingyao and I weren't women,)

162
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,120
(posing no threat to their power,)

163
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,080
(we probably wouldn't have lived now.)

164
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:25,559
Xingyao,

165
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,320
we have two choices now.

166
00:11:28,679 --> 00:11:30,360
Either we run far away right now

167
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:31,960
and hide forever,

168
00:11:32,519 --> 00:11:33,519
or...

169
00:11:33,559 --> 00:11:35,679
I'm still betrothed to the Zhang family.

170
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,120
As long as they remain in power,

171
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,720
we will never live in peace.

172
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,320
Wangshu,

173
00:11:46,639 --> 00:11:48,120
I want the latter choice.

174
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:59,799
Prince Qi's power is huge,
and his faction's everywhere.

175
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,840
His Majesty is biding his time

176
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,000
and won't remain a puppet forever.

177
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:07,879
I heard His Majesty
is using the Merchant Coalition

178
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,559
to quietly impede Prince Qi.

179
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,639
The Merchant Coalition?

180
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,759
The incredibly wealthy coalition

181
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:17,519
- that even officials bow to them?
- Exactly.

182
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:20,159
Wangshu, do you intend to approach them?

183
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,200
Yes.

184
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,360
Diving straight
into the power struggle...

185
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,480
What if you lose?

186
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:30,360
Back then,
I urged you to elope with Zhu Heng,

187
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,159
thinking he was the right one.

188
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:34,799
But it almost cost you your life.

189
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:39,559
Besides, your sacrifice was decreed
by His Majesty himself.

190
00:12:40,039 --> 00:12:41,039
Watch your step.

191
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,399
Who knows if he can be trusted?

192
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:47,960
That's why I'll keep my identity hidden.

193
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,240
I won't rely on him.

194
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,480
I will use him.

195
00:12:53,159 --> 00:12:54,159
Xingyao,

196
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,080
you didn't hurt me.

197
00:12:56,519 --> 00:12:58,080
You gave us a trump card

198
00:12:58,279 --> 00:12:59,960
that no one could have anticipated.

199
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,159
But the Loong Lord is stuck
in the abyss.

200
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,559
How could he help us?

201
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:09,440
His guard can help.

202
00:13:09,759 --> 00:13:13,200
- He will contact the Loong Lord.
- That guard?

203
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,240
Anyway, I've sent a visit note.

204
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,240
Let's go.

205
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,159
What a handsome gentleman!

206
00:13:23,198 --> 00:13:24,331
Indeed.

207
00:13:24,694 --> 00:13:25,759
So handsome!

208
00:13:25,759 --> 00:13:27,000
Gorgeous!

209
00:13:39,679 --> 00:13:40,679
Young Master.

210
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,600
Young Master.

211
00:13:49,519 --> 00:13:50,519
Young Master.

212
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,960
What's the fun
in staring at dead things?

213
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,000
I know a great place!

214
00:14:03,126 --> 00:14:05,200
(Drunken Dream)

215
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:08,480
- Young Master.
- Come on in!

216
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,080
Come inside and have some fun!

217
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:13,240
Right this way, Young Master!

218
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:25,679
Young Master, you look new around here.

219
00:14:26,399 --> 00:14:27,879
Girls, come over!

220
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,679
Come on in, Young Master!

221
00:14:31,919 --> 00:14:35,519
Our ladies will take you
straight to cloud nine!

222
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,240
What's going on?

223
00:14:42,559 --> 00:14:45,080
Young Master, didn't you want to learn?

224
00:14:46,159 --> 00:14:49,480
This is the best place in town for that.

225
00:14:49,919 --> 00:14:51,159
Guaranteed results!

226
00:14:54,279 --> 00:14:55,919
Ladies, welcome our guest!

227
00:14:55,987 --> 00:14:59,097
(Merchant Coalition)

228
00:15:02,068 --> 00:15:03,068
(Merchant Coalition)

229
00:15:04,919 --> 00:15:06,320
I hope everything goes smoothly.

230
00:15:39,759 --> 00:15:41,200
Quickly, get out of here!

231
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:44,120
Go to Chunfeng Pavilion
and find Master Wei Xun!

232
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:46,320
Tell him there's trouble here

233
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:48,240
and to leave immediately!

234
00:15:52,519 --> 00:15:54,000
Xingyao, you head back first.

235
00:15:54,279 --> 00:15:55,440
I'll go find Master Wei Xun.

236
00:15:56,679 --> 00:15:57,679
Wait, Wangshu.

237
00:16:00,689 --> 00:16:03,399
(Wei Xun,
honored guest of Merchant Coalition)

238
00:16:03,399 --> 00:16:04,440
If not his men,

239
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:07,440
who else would dare cause trouble here?

240
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,559
I visited Merchant Coalition

241
00:16:11,759 --> 00:16:13,039
and found it had been attacked.

242
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,039
Everyone inside was slaughtered.

243
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:17,000
Given the manager's last wish,

244
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:18,840
I came to find Master Wei Xun

245
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,360
to warn him to flee at once.

246
00:16:20,879 --> 00:16:22,360
Let the gentleman in.

247
00:16:26,879 --> 00:16:27,879
Move.

248
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,440
Assassins!

249
00:16:34,879 --> 00:16:36,279
Look! What's happening?

250
00:16:58,369 --> 00:17:02,944
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

251
00:17:03,719 --> 00:17:08,216
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

252
00:17:11,455 --> 00:17:16,577
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

253
00:17:16,577 --> 00:17:19,916
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

254
00:17:19,916 --> 00:17:21,280
♪Refusing to forget♪

255
00:17:24,946 --> 00:17:29,723
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

256
00:17:30,274 --> 00:17:32,064
♪He cannot learn them♪

257
00:17:32,064 --> 00:17:35,199
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

258
00:17:38,351 --> 00:17:40,675
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

259
00:17:40,675 --> 00:17:43,038
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

260
00:17:43,616 --> 00:17:46,280
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

261
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:48,038
♪Their days ahead are long♪
